[{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01100000_02_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01100000_02_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01100000_02_0002","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01100000_02_0010","text":"嗯…………！\n……还能吃？……不，可是……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01100000_02_0020","text":"……？\n智代子？要再加烤一片吐司吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01100000_02_0030","text":"制作人……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01100000_02_0040","text":"……我正在纠结……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01100000_02_0050","text":"要是肚子饿的话\n还是吃了比较好哦……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01100000_02_0060","text":"早餐时间也快结束了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01100000_02_0070","text":"──第一片，我是放了煎蛋吃的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01100000_02_0080","text":"诶？\n哦、哦哦……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01100000_02_0090","text":"第二片，涂了厚厚的黄油和果酱──"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01100000_02_0100","text":"是啊，看你吃得很香"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01100000_02_0110","text":"这之上，还要……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01100000_02_0120","text":"……哦，太多了吗……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01100000_02_0130","text":"平时都是吃两片的！\n可是，今天的吐司是八片切的……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01100000_02_0140","text":"我家的是六片切的……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01100000_02_0150","text":"──啊……！\n所以计算才会乱掉啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01100000_02_0003","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01100000_02_0160","text":"…………怎么办？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01100000_02_0170","text":"……──我、我放弃……！"}]
